<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>倾听 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</title><link>https://yousali.com/tags/%E5%80%BE%E5%90%AC/</link><description>Recent content in 倾听 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.148.1</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:33:45 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yousali.com/tags/%E5%80%BE%E5%90%AC/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>放弃咨询准备送客时，那位母亲在门口转过身来</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/carl-rogers-active-listening/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/carl-rogers-active-listening/</guid><description>20 世纪 30 年代后期，卡尔·罗杰斯在罗切斯特一次陷入僵局的咨询里，直到放弃专家诊断、坦承束手无策，对方才转身道出真正困局；但安静倾听也有它的前提与边界。</description></item><item><title>气骂“会须杀此田舍翁”那天，李世民为什么又把话听进去了</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/tang-taizong-listening-weizheng/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/tang-taizong-listening-weizheng/</guid><description>贞观六年李世民因魏征当庭顶撞动了杀心，长孙皇后换上朝服道贺才让他咽下这口气；可十余年后缓冲不在，疑心照样让他推倒了魏征的墓碑。</description></item></channel></rss>